criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Adult patients aged 18 years or older;
* Recipients of a kidney transplant from a living donor, a donor after brain death, or a donor after circulatory death;
* Patients who have provided written informed consent to participate in the ABAT study.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Pregnant or breastfeeding women;
* Patients under legal protection measures (including guardianship or curatorship);
* Patients who have undergone more than two kidney transplantations;
* Patients who have received a combined transplant or a previous transplant of another organ.
